<title>USA: Sallie Mae prices floating rate note issue.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae prices floating rate note issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said Monday it priced a $600 million issue of short-term floating rate notes at 20 basis points above the 91-day U.S. Treasury bill.</p>
<p>When-issued trading is expected to begin at 0820 hrs EDT (1220 GMT) Tuesday, it said.  </p>
<p>The notes are for settlement July 17. Maturity date is Jan 15, 1998. Cusip number is 86387TFD5.</p>
<p>The interest rate on the notes will be reset the day after each weekly bill auction.</p>
</text>
